WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
They call me Kestrel. That wasn’t my first name.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I was born Mara Vale beneath a clinic light that flickered every six seconds. My mother gave me one thing the city could not repossess: a copper bird.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
At six, the world was market smoke, music, and her hand in mine.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
At nine, corporate security took our home and my mother with it.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
At thirteen, I learned every lock is only a question. I stole medicine. I told myself that made me good.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
At sixteen, I stopped a convoy. The crash took more than the target. I still don’t know their names.

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
At nineteen, my crew sold me out. I went back for the one they left behind. I lost the arm and found the rule I still live by. No one gets left behind.

8
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
A street doctor rebuilt me. I chose a new name. The city wrote the wounds. I chose what they meant.

9
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Origin Dossier turns every scar, debt, promise, enemy, and secret into the runner at your table. Not a backstory. A life with consequences.
